      "value": "They would likely need players to use well optimized avatars for decent performance and if they force players to do so people will complain, and if they don't people will complain about poor performance.\nSeems far more efficient to make smaller worlds catered to a certain experience with pretty good performance then it is to make a large world with poor performance but can do multiple different types of experiences.",
